{"title":"促投资政策加码 多地PPP项目“上马”","date":"2017-11-24","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 21pt; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">促投资政策加码　多地<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>项目&ldquo;上马&rdquo;</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 21pt; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　国家发展和改革委员会透露，促投资推广<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式专题会议日前举行，未来将进一步深化投融资体制改革，加大推进<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式的政策支持和落实力度，多措并举激发民间投资活力。与此同时，多地一批新的<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>项目也开始大规模落地，<b>财政部第四批<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>申报项目投资额将超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>万亿元。</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　发改委表示，一段时期以来，各地在促进民间投资快速增长、规范有序推进<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式，以及加强投资项目事中事后监管等方面取得了成效。未来，发改委将综合考虑各地的成功经验，进一步深化投融资体制改革、持续出台政策激发民间投资活力。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　据了解，近来，在加大民间投资支持力度方面，发改委等部门连续出台重磅政策，深入推进<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式等发展。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　<b>发改委投资司副司长韩志峰表示，当前投融资体制改革已进入深水区，企业投资项目承诺制是下一步改革的突破口之一。</b>要通过改革实现流程再造和机制再构，推动政府进一步转变职能，不断优化营商环境，让企业有实实在在的&ldquo;获得感&rdquo;。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　财政部<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>日也表示，正在会同行业部委组织评选第四批<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>示范项目，重点聚焦连片特困地区发展、美丽乡村建设、生态环境治理、基本公共服务供给等领域，共征集各地申报项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">1226</span>个，投资额<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.12</span>万亿元。而截至目前，财政部已会同行业部委推出三批共<span lang=\"EN-US\">697</span>个<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>示范项目，投资额<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.8</span>万亿元，其中已落地项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">572</span>个，投资额<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.5</span>万亿元。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　在中央政策的助推下，各地<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>项目也开始大规模落地。天津市发改委<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>日公布了<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>个<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>项目，总投资近<span lang=\"EN-US\">1500</span>亿元，涉及交通运输、水利、环境保护、林业、重大市政工程和特色小镇等领域。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　数据显示，截至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2017</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月底，全国入库项目已有<span lang=\"EN-US\">14220</span>个，投资额<span lang=\"EN-US\">17.8</span>万亿元。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　与此同时，各部门对<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>项目的监管也更加严格。今年以来，从规范地方政府举债融资行为，到坚决制止地方以政府购买服务名义违法违规融资，再到财政部等部委发文对<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>资产证券化进行规范，国家对<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式的监管不断强化。<b>日前，财政部发布规范<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>项目库管理的通知，针对<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>近年发展过程中在项目类别、项目性质、项目内容、项目前期工作、项目结构设计、项目绩效考核等方面出现的问题进行了列举，被称为&ldquo;史上最严&rdquo;的<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>规范文件。</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">　　对此，清华大学教授王守清表示，</span><b style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">未来<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式的发展将更规范更理性。</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}